msgstr "ジャカルタ REST 4"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "JSON Merge Patch, new multipart API."
msgstr "JSON Merge Patch、新しいマルチパートAPI。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
