#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dedicated JMS extension with compatibility with Spring JMS, pooled JMS, and IronJacamar."
msgstr "Spring JMS、プール型JMS、およびIronJacamarとの互換性を備えた、専用のJMS拡張機能です。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
